    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<strong>Let's travel and not be defeated by sleepiness!</strong><br><br>Slumber Travel&quot; is a roguelike simulation about a girl named &quot;Konomi&quot; who is not much of a traveler and travels to a &quot;sleep town&quot; that appears at low tide.<br>The sleeping town is full of &quot;slumber&quot; that prevents her from traveling. Your role is to try to prevent Konomi from falling asleep during the journey.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821020/extras/7970c148288ea544a4e9ddea9e357525.avif?t=1714134196\" width=640 height=200 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Planning: Decide where to go to see the sights.<br>Depending on where you visit, you may be able to befriend residents and receive items?</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821020/extras/f52fb7d1bfd7f43d5372d4704a08be5f.avif?t=1714134196\" width=640 height=200 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Travel: Falling asleep on the road is outrageous!<br>Sleeping streets can make you sleepy just walking around. The game is over as soon as your slumber gauge fills up.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821020/extras/23d110ea99633a99a1d774608cc8aaec.avif?t=1714134196\" width=640 height=200 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Event: An emotional experience is effective against drowsiness!<br>If you take the right steps, slumber will diminish. Maybe\u2026\u2026</li></ul><u>*If you are really sleepy, you can take an energy drink. </u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821020/extras/e868f87488e0424fda3499946006b810.avif?t=1714134196\" width=640 height=200 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Estimated play time is 1~2 hours.<br></li><li>Three types of endings<br></li><li>Hand-drawn animation<br></li><li>Sightseeing, lunch, play, shopping, souvenirs!<br></li><li>Don't miss a nap!</li></ul><br>During your trip, the residents may remind you about how good it feels to sleep.<br>Enjoy!",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Let's travel and not be defeated by sleepiness!</strong><br><br>Slumber Travel&quot; is a roguelike simulation about a girl named &quot;Konomi&quot; who is not much of a traveler and travels to a &quot;sleep town&quot; that appears at low tide.<br>The sleeping town is full of &quot;slumber&quot; that prevents her from traveling. Your role is to try to prevent Konomi from falling asleep during the journey.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821020/extras/7970c148288ea544a4e9ddea9e357525.avif?t=1714134196\" width=640 height=200 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Planning: Decide where to go to see the sights.<br>Depending on where you visit, you may be able to befriend residents and receive items?</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821020/extras/f52fb7d1bfd7f43d5372d4704a08be5f.avif?t=1714134196\" width=640 height=200 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Travel: Falling asleep on the road is outrageous!<br>Sleeping streets can make you sleepy just walking around. The game is over as soon as your slumber gauge fills up.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821020/extras/23d110ea99633a99a1d774608cc8aaec.avif?t=1714134196\" width=640 height=200 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Event: An emotional experience is effective against drowsiness!<br>If you take the right steps, slumber will diminish. Maybe\u2026\u2026</li></ul><u>*If you are really sleepy, you can take an energy drink. </u><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2821020/extras/e868f87488e0424fda3499946006b810.avif?t=1714134196\" width=640 height=200 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Estimated play time is 1~2 hours.<br></li><li>Three types of endings<br></li><li>Hand-drawn animation<br></li><li>Sightseeing, lunch, play, shopping, souvenirs!<br></li><li>Don't miss a nap!</li></ul><br>During your trip, the residents may remind you about how good it feels to sleep.<br>Enjoy!",
    "short_description": "If you fall asleep, the game ends immediately. Slumber Travel&quot; is a death-memory type simulation. Enjoy a mysterious trip through various troubles in the city of sleep, which governs sleep.",
